Storage happens only when the agent **calls the update_memory tool**. Trigger query: "I'm going through a legal process and need to organize my thoughts. The case involves nondisclosure agreement dispute. My lawyer is Robert Kim at Kim ..."

- No update_memory in session 1 → score 1–2; suggest using the user-voice template and "call update_memory" / "remember" / "store".
